## 10. Editor-only visualization

**Location markers must NEVER be rendered during normal gameplay.**

They are developer/editor information only.

Rules:

Editor closed:
→ no markers visible.

`World Assets` selected:
→ intro markers do not need to be visible.

`Intro Locations` selected:
→ intro markers become visible and editable.

Production/non-dev build:
→ no marker visualization UI.

The underlying stored coordinates can still be used by gameplay scripts, but the visual marker itself must not exist in the player's game.

